&lt;p&gt;As Senior Marketing Technology Manager, you will shape the systems that power performance marketing across Paid Acquisition, Paid Social, and SEO. You will own the technical foundation behind tagging, tracking, signal quality, and platform integrations, while helping evolve our broader MarTech ecosystem across customer data, consent, and automation. This role is built for a marketing technologist who moves fluidly from problem definition to implementation to measurement, and who can turn emerging AI capabilities into reliable, governed workflows that improve speed, accuracy, and business impact. Reporting to the Head of Marketing Technology, you will operate as a senior individual contributor with broad influence across marketing, engineering, data, legal, and privacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Google Tag Manager end-to-end across tagging, tracking, and pixel deployment, improving signal quality, match rates, and data reliability for Paid Acquisition, Paid Social, and SEO programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with channel teams to design and optimize browser-side and server-side measurement approaches, including Conversion API implementations and data syncs across CDP destinations and key platforms such as Meta, Google, LinkedIn, and Reddit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex MarTech initiatives across tracking architecture, customer data platform integrations, consent signal orchestration, and platform onboarding, driving durable solutions that improve speed to market and campaign performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and operationalize AI-enabled workflows that automate segmentation, campaign support, personalization, and marketing operations, with clear logic, measurable outputs, and appropriate human oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging AI tools, agent frameworks, and integration patterns, including model orchestration approaches such as MCP, and recommend scalable solutions based on business value, technical feasibility, and long-term maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Engineering, Data, Legal, and Privacy to embed consent, governance, and compliance requirements into tagging, data collection, and AI-assisted marketing workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create leverage for surrounding teams by translating business needs into technical requirements, resolving operational blockers, and establishing clear processes such as office hours, intake, and prioritization that make marketing teams measurably faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Author and maintain Privacy Impact Assessments and data-flow documentation for marketing data, clearly articulating where data originates, transfer mechanisms, the processing purpose, and the regulatory basis and gating controls that apply, in partnership with Legal and Privacy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What It Takes to Catch Our Eye:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in marketing technology implementation across Google Tag Manager, Google Analytics, pixel strategy, server-side tagging, and advanced data layer design, paired with strong judgment on how to improve measurement quality across paid and organic channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead complex cross-functional initiatives as a senior individual contributor, balancing strategic thinking with hands-on execution across MarTech, analytics, data pipelines, and stakeholder alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical fluency in SQL, analytics tooling, and data troubleshooting, with experience partnering closely with engineers and data teams to diagnose issues and build reliable, scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Author and maintain Privacy Impact Assessments and data-flow documentation for marketing data, clearly articulating where data originates, the transfer mechanism used, the processing purpose, and the regulatory basis and gating controls that apply, in partnership with Legal and Privacy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptive use of AI in technical workflows, including designing prompts, testing outputs, and integrating AI tools or agents into marketing operations to improve speed, accuracy, and execution quality while maintaining human review and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder’s mindset grounded in sound judgment: you know when to automate, when to simplify, and how to turn repeated pain points into systems that scale across teams instead of creating long-term operational debt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;C&lt;/strong&gt;ome change how the world works.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Upwork is establishing an operational hub in Toronto, Canada. The new office is expected to be fully operational by Q4 2026. This role will require 3 days in office once we have an office open.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position will initially be employed through a partner to ensure a seamless hiring process while we establish the hub. Once the hub is established, there may be opportunities to transition to employment with Upwork, depending on business needs and other requirements. While employed by the partner, you’ll work as part of Upwork’s team, with access to our resources, culture, and growth opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our partner will offer competitive benefits. When Upwork’s hub is established, we will be excited to offer employment and benefits directly as business needs require.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Upwork is committed to building a diverse, inclusive, and equitable workforce. Employment decisions are made without regard to race, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, or any other status protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use BrightHire, an AI-enabled tool, to record interviews and summarize interview transcripts. The tool allows the interviewer to focus on the discussion and does not score or evaluate candidates or make recommendations. The interview transcripts are reviewed, and decisions are only made by humans. Candidates who prefer not to have their interview recorded through BrightHire can opt out when the interview is scheduled.&lt;/p&gt;
